:{"Node name for S&R":"Note"},"widgets_values":["## Looping Reference + Prompt Guidance\n\nUse the Tile References + Tile Snippets helper for the image/prompt batch and schedule. Its frame_rate output should feed the Multi-Prompt node and other frame-rate-dependent nodes.\n\n### Reference placement\n- Image 0 is the initial image at index 0.\n- Image 1 onward should be the intended end image of the previous tile, inside that tile's final overlap. Do not place it at the next tile's start.\n- Keep reference_offset at or above 0.35 s (never 0); choose a value inside the overlap, often near its middle.\n- A bypassed or unwired image source leaves that slot missing. The slot index is preserved, so later image slots do not shift; the corresponding prompts remain.\n\n### Continuity\nThe next tile receives the prior tile's overlap as a temporal guide and regenerates that overlap before continuing into new frames. A reference is assigned to one tile, not directly applied again in the next tile. If references make motion too rigid, reduce cond_image_strength first; temporal_overlap_cond_strength controls overlap continuity.\n\nThe global prompt is optional and appears first. Per-image snippets are concatenated with it and joined with `|` for the looping samplers."],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":80,"type":"RepeatImageBatch","pos":[11,430],"size":[220,58],"flags":{},"order":15,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"name":"image","type":"IMAGE","link":66},{"name":"amount","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"amount"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"name":"IMAGE","type":"IMAGE","slot_index":0,"links":[67]}],"title":"Repeat Ref Image (3x)","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.18.5","Node name for S&R":"RepeatImageBatch"},"widgets_values":[3]},{"id":81,"type":"RepeatImageBatch","pos":[11,650],"size":[220,58],"flags":{},"order":16,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"name":"image","type":"IMAGE","link":68},{"name":"amount","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"amount"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"name":"IMAGE","type":